    <briefdescription>
<para>Specialisation of <computeroutput><ref refid="class_d_mat_lin_alg" kindref="compound">DMatLinAlg</ref></computeroutput> for <computeroutput>ARingQQ</computeroutput> dense matrices, routing every linear-algebra query (rank, determinant, kernel, inverse, solve) through FLINT&apos;s <computeroutput>fmpq_mat_*</computeroutput> routines. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Constructs <computeroutput><ref refid="class_flint_q_q_mat" kindref="compound">FlintQQMat</ref></computeroutput> translations on demand (via <computeroutput><ref refid="dmat-qq-interface-flint_8hpp" kindref="compound">dmat-qq-interface-flint.hpp</ref></computeroutput>), runs the corresponding FLINT call, and converts the result back into <computeroutput><ref refid="class_d_mat" kindref="compound">DMat</ref>&lt;ARingQQ&gt;</computeroutput>. Saves the engine from having to re-implement Bareiss-style rational elimination on top of GMP rationals. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
